<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · song</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sukiyaki (Ue o Muite Arukō)</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">first released <a href="/years/1961">1961</a>; US number one <a href="/years/1963">1963</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a> · Also known as 上を向いて歩こう, Ue o Muite Arukō</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">&quot;Ue o Muite Arukō&quot; (&quot;I Look Up as I Walk&quot;) was written by the lyricist Rokusuke Ei and the composer Hachidai Nakamura and sung by Kyu Sakamoto, who released it in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/japan">Japan</a> in 1961.</p></div>
